    "bodyText": "Skip to primary navigation\nSkip to main content\nSkip to footer\nHome\n \nServices\n \nIce Machines\n \nAbout Us\n \nBlog\n \nContact\nEZ TEMP\nHeating, Cooling, Commercial Refrigeration, and Ice Machines.\nSchedule Consultation\nCall (201) 457-9797\nEMERGENCY HOTLINE:\n(201) 457-9797 ext. 1\nEZ TEMP\n\nOur fleet is ready to assist your company.\n\nServing Bergen, Passaic & Hudson Counties Since 2001\n\nWe are the most trusted heating, cooling, and refrigeration installation, maintenance, and repair company in Bergen, Passaic, and Hudson Counties, and all of northern New Jersey.\n\n24/7 Emergency Repair\n\nWe offer 24-hour emergency repair service, for both heating and refrigeration, residential or commercial. Our expert technicians are always available to take your call, and to come to your business or location to solve your heating or cooling problem.\n\nAbout Us\nHeating\nIce Machines\nDeli Cases\nOur Featured Services\nHeating\n\nOur commercial heating services include installation, maintenance, and repair of furnaces, rooftop heating units, boilers, and package heated makeup, among many other types of heating units.\n\nRefrigeration\n\nOur technicians have years of experience installing commercial freezers, beer cases, deli cases, flower boxes, walk-in freezers, walk-in coolers, wine coolers, reach-ins, and all other types of commercial refrigerators.\n\nAC Services\n\nEZ Temp offers a wide selection of industrial AC & commercial air conditioning units which we install and service to guarantee your experience – and continued use of our products – is always the best it can be.\n\nQUESTIONS ABOUT YOUR HOME OR BUSINESS HVAC?\nASK AN EXPERT\nTestimonials\n“… Great customer service would definitely use them again …”\n\nHad a problem with our AC, they made it out within a couple hours and had us back up and running almost immediately! Great customer service would definitely use them again.\n\nCraig G.\n\n \n\n“… staff is friendly and fast. I felt comfortable with them in my house. …”\n\nMark was professional and fast. I called about an issue and he had one of his guys sent out within the hour to assist and fix my problem completely. His staff is friendly and fast. I felt comfortable with them in my house. I will recommend this company to anyone who is in need of HVAC assistance. They’re the best in the bizz!\n\nJessica C.\n\n \n\n“… were professional and responded quickly …”\n\nI called today in need of service to my HVAC unit. Mark took my call and called back later on when I got home from work. He sent Anthony to service my unit and had me up and running quickly. Anthony explained the needs and pointed out that caps were missing and the installer neglected to put them on. These guys were professional and responded quickly. I run into people every day at work. I will not hesitate to recommend this company to anyone. Thank you guys!!!!\n\nPeter G.\n“… and they showed up in less than 3 hours …”\n\nGreat and fast service really happy with this company my walk-in cooler for my business Nutricentro stopped working I called up E-Z Temp and they showed up in less than 3 hours. Awesome work Guys I really appreciate Jessie’s patience he’s the man !\n\nJose M.\n1\n2\n3\n4\nFooter\n\nContact us now for repair service, including heating and refrigeration, for residential or commercial.\n\nEZTEMP © 2026",
