      "bodyText": "Skip to primary navigation\nSkip to main content\nSkip to primary sidebar\nSkip to footer\nHome\n \nServices\n \nIce Machines\n \nAbout Us\n \nBlog\n \nContact\nAbout EZ Temp\n\nThere are few things as frustrating as trying to find a commercial refrigeration, heating and air conditioning company to respond to your emergency needs especially after normal business hours and on weekends. Once you locate a company, how do you know that they are qualified, reliable, and ethical?\n\nDon’t subject yourself to potential dangers by attempting to repair a refrigeration, A/C or heating system. In addition to the potential for personal injury you face when attempting to repair your system yourself, you also run the risk of voiding your manufacturer’s warranty.\n\n\nOur refrigeration, A/C & heating services include:\n24-Hour Emergency Service\nCommercial Heat\nCommercial Refrigeration\nCommercial and Residential Air Conditioning\nIce Machines\nBeer Cases\nDeli Cases\nFreezers\nReach-in Coolers\nWalk-in Boxes\nWine Coolers\nRepair and Service\n\nEZ Temp’s Pledge to You:\n\n“When you need it done right, and right away, give us a call. We offer 24 Hour Emergency Service to all of North Bergen County, New Jersey.”\n\n-Owner, Mark Sakhat!\n\nPrimary Sidebar\nContact EZ Temp\nName(Required)\nFirst\nLast\nZip Code\nPhone(Required)\nEmail(Required)\nEnter Email\nConfirm Email\nMessage(Required)\nPlease let us know what's on your mind. Have a question for us? Ask away.\n0 of 600 max characters\nSubmit\nIs Your Cooling Equipment Ready for the Rush of Summer?\nSummer Comfort Depends on What Happens Behind the Scenes\nSummer Cooling Is About More Than Comfort\nDon’t Let Summer Heat Slow Down Your Home or Business\nKeep Your Cool When Summer Temperatures Climb\nFooter\n\nContact us now for repair service, including heating and refrigeration, for residential or commercial.\n\nEZTEMP © 2026",
